@UnderworldEmpire.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Liveness — 200 whenever the process is up
GET {{UnderworldEmpire.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Readiness — needs Postgres on 5433
GET {{UnderworldEmpire.Api_HostAddress}}/health/db
Accept: application/json

### Create a guest session. Copy deviceToken from the response into @token below.
# @name session
POST {{UnderworldEmpire.Api_HostAddress}}/session
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
@token = paste-the-deviceToken-here

### Resume an existing session (same player back)
POST {{UnderworldEmpire.Api_HostAddress}}/session
Content-Type: application/json

{ "deviceToken": "{{token}}" }

### Auth probe
GET {{UnderworldEmpire.Api_HostAddress}}/whoami
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### The active content pack (anonymous — no token needed)
GET {{UnderworldEmpire.Api_HostAddress}}/content/pack
Accept: application/json

### Player projection: meters, currencies, level/XP/stats
GET {{UnderworldEmpire.Api_HostAddress}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Job catalog with this player's mastery and affordability (M2-A)
GET {{UnderworldEmpire.Api_HostAddress}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Do a job (M2-B). No body — every figure is decided server-side.
### Ten runs of this 1-energy job award exactly 100 XP = level 2, and 10 completions = mastery rank 1.
POST {{UnderworldEmpire.Api_HostAddress}}/jobs/shake-down-corner-store/do
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A level-3 job — expect 409 with reason "level" until you are level 3
POST {{UnderworldEmpire.Api_HostAddress}}/jobs/hijack-a-delivery-truck/do
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Spend a skill point (M2-C). Target is "attack" or "defense", case-insensitive.
POST {{UnderworldEmpire.Api_HostAddress}}/skills/allocate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "attack" }
